During a news conference on Tuesday, investigating officer Brig. Gen. Bruce Oliveira shared details of the state’s probe and said when the mistake was realized, the employee “[f]ro[ze]” and “seemed[ confused].” Another employee had to resume his duties and send a correction[ message], Oliveira said.
